Is S-Plus 8 64 bit, or does it merely *run* on a 64 bit platform? I 
thought S-Plus 8 was a 32 bit application.

Regardless I believe that S-Plus always retains all available digits in 
any of the dataExport or data.dump functions. If you intent is ti export 
data from S-Plus 6 and import it into S-Plus 8, perhaps you would be 
better served by data.dump.

Kim Elmore

