Unfortunately I can't answer this one!

> b) How can I force
> exportData to produce the same output (number of digits) as write.
> table? options(digits = 3) didn’t seem to help.

If you use the "format" argument of "exportData" you could get pretty much
what you want, e.g.

> x <- sqrt(1:3)
> x <- cbind(x, x)
> x
            x        x
[1,] 1.000000 1.000000
[2,] 1.414214 1.414214
[3,] 1.732051 1.732051
> exportData(data = x,
+            file = "test.txt",
+            type = "FASCII", format = "%6.3,%6.3")

will yield:

 1.000 1.000
 1.414 1.414
 1.732 1.732

Hoping this helps,

