See pp. 139-140 of Everitt's An R and S-PLUS Companion to 
Multivariate Statistics.

The formulae straightforward and apparently simple. Just a scaled 
Mahalanobis D^2 distance based on the pooled covariance matrix and 
some scaling by sample sizes.

